flowchart TD
  A[Outgoing Shift Active] --> B[Record Tasks & Incidents]
  B --> C[Draft Handover via prepare]
  
  subgraph EnginePrep [Continuity Engine: Preparation]
    C --> C1{Validate Shift IDs}
    C1 -->|Invalid / Identical| C_Err[Return Error]
    C1 -->|Valid| C2{Check Duplicate Open Handover}
    C2 -->|Duplicate Exists| C_DupErr[Reject Duplicate]
    C2 -->|No Duplicate| C3[Aggregate Unresolved Items]
    C3 --> C4[Filter Out Completed / Resolved]
    C4 --> C5[Attach Original IDs to Handover]
  end
  
  C5 --> D[Advance: Draft ➔ Submitted ➔ Awaiting Sign-off]
  D --> E[Incoming Shift Review Checklist]
  
  subgraph EngineAck [Continuity Engine: Acknowledgement]
    E --> F{Review Checkbox Checked?}
    F -->|No| F_Block[Block Acknowledgement]
    F -->|Yes| G[Run acknowledge]
    G --> H{Detect Out-of-band Conflicts}
    H -->|Item Reassigned Away| H_Conflict[Preserve Newer Assignment & Log Conflict]
    H -->|Item Valid & Open| H_Carry[Transfer Shift to Incoming]
    H_Carry --> I[Set Status to Carried Forward]
    I --> J[Increment carry Counter]
    J --> K{carry >= 2?}
    K -->|Yes| K_Risk[Flag Repeat Continuity Risk]
    K -->|No| L[Record Custody Provenance in History]
  end
  
  L --> M[Handover Formally Acknowledged]
  M --> N[Work Continues in Incoming Shift]
  N --> O[Item Completed / Resolved]
  O --> P[Mandatory Notes Verified & closedShift Recorded]
